    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.59,
      594.56,
      542.0,
      619.86
    ],
    "text": "The Sri Lanka Navy Women's Service Regulations, 1989, Published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 799/7 of December 27, 1993 are hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.59,
      630.72,
      149.97,
      643.86
    ],
    "text": "(1) In regulation 16 \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.59,
      654.56,
      541.86,
      679.86
    ],
    "text": "(a) by the substitution in paragraph (c) for the words \u201cat the age of forty five years.\u201d, of the words \u201cat the age of fifty five (55) years.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      70.86,
      515.57,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'02'15Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.02.20252A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.76,
      747.01,
      421.81,
      756.21
    ],
    "text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.68,
      98.76,
      415.28,
      112.06
    ],
    "text": "(b) by the repeal of paragraph (e) and the substitution therefor of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.66,
      122.92,
      549.18,
      160.06
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(e) A commissioned officer who retires from service may be transferred to the Regular Naval Reserve and retained until she reaches the age of Sixty (60) years, or such shorter period as may be determined by the Commander of Navy,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.66,
      170.92,
      213.54,
      184.06
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the proviso to regulation 29 \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.66,
      194.76,
      419.7,
      208.06
    ],
    "text": "(a) by the repeal of paragraph (a) and the substitution therefore of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.64,
      218.92,
      549.14,
      244.06
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(a) the original enlistment Period of a woman Sailor shall not exceed fifteen (15) years and after that she may be discharged:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.64,
      254.92,
      549.16,
      304.06
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, if any woman sailor has been enlisted for a particular profession or has been undergone a special training, such woman sailor may not be allowed to retire upon completion of the fifteen years service period if the Commander of Navy is of the opinion that such retirement is detrimental to the interest of Sri Lanka Navy,\";",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.65,
      314.76,
      549.15,
      340.06
    ],
    "text": "(b) by the substitution in paragraph (b) for the words \u201ctwenty years:\u201d, of the words and figures \u201ctwenty two (22) years:\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.65,
      350.76,
      549.14,
      376.06
    ],
    "text": "(c) by the substitution in paragraph (c) for the words \u201ctwenty years:\u201d, of the words and figures \u201ctwenty two years (22)\u201d ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      54.65,
      386.92,
      205.18,
      400.06
    ],
    "text": "(3) by the repeal of regulation 37.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
